MACCS.smarts
============

The SMARTS patterns in MACCS.smarts define the publicly available MDL MACCS
keys. They were written by Greg Landrum for RDKit (rdkit/Chem/MACCSKeys.py)
and are distributed with Open Babel as data/MACCS.txt, from which UManSysProp
originally read them through Pybel. AeroSysProp keeps the patterns and
evaluates them with RDKit. Unlike the reference implementations, AeroSysProp
returns match counts rather than forcing each key to 0 or 1.

